WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:11.350
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:22.360
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:31.840
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.300
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.350
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.640
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.520
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.730
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:01.390
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:10.080
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:17.080
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:22.550
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.720
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:39.540
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:43.540
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:46.080
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:55.090
However, wherever they went,
fearsome minions sent forth...

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:59.490
...by High Priest Zagato awaited
them, eager to end their lives.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:15.370
Pushing enemies back
and defeating monsters...

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.110
Hikaru and company managed
to acquire the legendary ore escudo.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:23.010
Now, as their weapons evolve,
they set forth on a new journey...

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:28.560
...to revive the Rune-God
and become Magic Knights.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:50.410
The Horrible Trap of Summoner Ascot

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.100
Beast Summon!

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.220
Both Atalante and Pajero
were defeated by them!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.850
I swore I'd avenge their deaths.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.790
Go, Vigor!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.440
Just watch, Magic Knights.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.140
This time, I will...

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:27.010
T-This forest gives me the creeps.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:28.840
I agree.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.980
It seems like a ghost
will appear any moment.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.020
Hikaru, aren't you scared at all?

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:39.750
Nope.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.220
Not at all!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:45.220
We wasted our time asking.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:49.160
I wish I could be confident
all the time like Hikaru.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:17.290
It seems that Cephiro
is continuing to crumble.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:19.990
We have to revive
the Rune-God quickly.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.590
Let's hurry! Mokona!

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.000
What's wrong?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.980
What?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.630
What was that?

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.290
Mokona!

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.000
It seems that...

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.070
Yeah.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.200
...he's gotten dizzy.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.940
You can tell that just by looking!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.240
Let's go!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:25.020
T-This can't be...

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.030
S-So cruel!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.460
This is too much...

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.280
Hikaru!

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:53.990
Hikaru!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.890
I think Ms. Hikaru is trying
to save that little creature.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.100
How terrible...

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:17.310
Hold on, I'll save you.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.120
No!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.410
No!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.680
Ms. Umi!

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.250
Ms. Umi, are you hurt?

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.920
I'm all right.
But you're amazing, Fuu.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:09.790
The sword is so much
stronger after evolving!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.870
They were all... by that monster...

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:27.780
This world has turned into one where
monsters roam anywhere we go.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:32.520
This little guy's mom
and siblings were all...

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:37.680
It's all Zagato's fault! It's because
he kidnapped Princess Emeraude!

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:45.800
You're badly injured too...

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.840
Poor thing...

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.530
I feel as though
we must do something.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.700
Sir Mokona.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:05.610
Oh, medicine!

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:07.240
And bandages!

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.450
You really do carry everything.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.110
You can't follow us.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:30.870
You have to go home now...

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:32.910
T-They're all...

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:38.680
Even if you go, that monster
killed your family so you're all alone!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.750
Ms. Hikaru...

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.620
We have to get going.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.620
I'm taking him with me!

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:47.190
Look here!

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:51.160
We don't know what kinda hideous
monsters are gonna show up!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.430
But if we leave him here,
monsters will attack again!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.600
I'm not saying this because
I have anything against that critter.

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.730
We are in a bind...

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:04.470
Hey, let's stay here with
him till his wounds heal!

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.510
Two or three days, till he
can run if monsters attack.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.070
No, even just tonight!
Come on, please!

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.450
Well, the sun's about to set...

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.720
I believe we have no option.

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.880
Thanks, Umi, Fuu!

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.190
"Hikari," huh?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.290
She named it Hikari.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.260
That was the name
of Ms. Hikaru's dog.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.320
That tickles, Hikari.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.660
Hikari, huh?

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:02.670
Those girls are so stupid.
They don't know they're Vigor's prey.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:10.870
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:14.840
Hikaru!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.350
Come on, Hikaru! Where are you?

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.490
What's going on
so early in the morning?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.730
I can't find Hikaru and Hikari!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.930
Where could they have gone?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.460
I am sure they just
went for a morning walk.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.380
Hikari had such
a serious wound too...

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.600
Wait! Wait!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.520
I'm so glad
your wound's healed, Hikari!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:04.460
The sky's so beautiful...

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.760
It's such a peaceful world...

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:16.070
Why is Zagato trying to ruin it?

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.650
Right, Hikari?

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.580
Hikari?

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.250
Hey, where'd you go?

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:32.860
Oh, Hikari!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:36.020
You shouldn't wander off
on your own like that.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.600
You'll get attacked
by a monster again.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.800
A flower?

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.830
Thanks, Hikari.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.280
There are lots more over there?

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:56.150
Oh, Hikari! Wait!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.420
I said wait!

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.210
Something is wrong, Ms. Umi.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.990
What's wrong?

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:10.460
Ms. Hikaru did not
return before breakfast.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.400
I am sure something
happened to her!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:15.660
Y-You think?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.070
Perhaps... a monster?

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:21.440
Wow!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.510
This is beautiful.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.850
It's amazing!
The flowers are like a carpet!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:33.220
All right, I'll make necklaces
with these flowers for Umi and Fuu.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:36.320
I'll make one for you too, Hikari.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.500
Ms. Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.600
Ms. Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.770
I thought she'd be around here.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:57.470
Something is wrong...

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.710
I wonder if she went
further into the forest...

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.590
There, I finished one.
I'll give you the first one...

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.460
Hikari?

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.240
Hikari...

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:46.730
Hikaru!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:47.990
Hikaru!
Ms. Hikaru!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.360
Umi... Fuu...

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:54.670
Don't...

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.030
Don't come over here!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.130
Ms. Hikaru!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.540
Hikaru!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.640
Hikaru!
Behind you, a monster!

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:02.610
Behind you, a monster!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.010
D-Don't!

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.680
Hikari...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.520
Don't kill Hikari!

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.730
Hikaru, what are you saying?

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:25.530
Where do you see
Hikari in that monster?

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.070
It's Hikari.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.360
Hikari just got bigger!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:37.470
She still doesn't get it.
What a stupid girl.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.210
Vigor, eat them all alive!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.140
Hikaru!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:48.420
Look out!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.060
Hikaru!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.360
Ms. Hikaru!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.840
How dare you trick us?

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.670
You're gonna pay!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.370
Ms. Hikaru! Are you all right?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:11.940
Fuu...

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.540
Hikari... Don't kill Hikari...

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.350
But that is...

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.680
It's Hikari.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:21.050
I'm sure Hikari just
got sick or something.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.920
Even if he turned into a monster...

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.930
Hikari is Hikari.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:36.100
Ms. Umi!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.770
Wait, Fuu!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.070
How dare you trick us?

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.440
Let me go, you!

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:06.720
Fuu!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.560
Stop...

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.130
Stop it, Hikari!

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:23.040
Hikari, calm down and listen to me.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.950
I'll fix you up right now.

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.990
Hikaru, don't you get it?

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:34.690
This isn't Hikari! It's a monster!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.060
Hikari...

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.130
Vigor...

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:46.270
Why are you hesitating?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.040
Don't listen to them... Listen...

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.870
Listen to me!

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.210
Who?

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:02.920
Hikari!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.890
Hikari, what's wrong with you?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.930
Hikari, stop! Please!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.080
This can't be...

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.330
Hikaru, at this rate...

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.870
...all the creatures in the forest
will end up alone like Hikari!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.610
And at this rate, we aren't gonna...

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.640
Hikaru!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.680
Fight... Fight the monster!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.150
Good! Good, Vigor!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.280
If you're my friend,
listen to what I say!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.520
Umi...

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.390
Umi...

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.990
Umi...

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:28.680
Umi...

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:36.650
Let go of her!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.470
Hikaru!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.260
T-The sword is...

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.150
...evolving!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.490
Hikari...

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.050
Vigor... Vigor...

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.440
You were my friend...

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:11.180
You were my dear friend...

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.180
Vigor!

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.850
Ms. Umi, the monster...

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.930
Was the monster defeated?

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.460
Yes.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:58.660
Someone...

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:01.970
One of Zagato's minions
was controlling Hikari.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.240
Hikari...

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:16.080
S-So... So horrible...

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:21.580
So...

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:39.760
Goodbye, Hikari.

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:55.510
Cephiro is still crumbling.

00:21:57.590 --> 00:21:59.680
It is all Zagato's fault.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.660
Let's go, Umi, Fuu!

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:06.590
Right.

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:12.440
We'll revive the Rune-God
and save this land, Cephiro.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:32.530
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:39.690
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:46.700
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:51.280
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:56.740
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:56.950 --> 00:22:59.390
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:04.290
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:11.960
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:17.970
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:25.140
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:31.080
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:46.630 --> 00:23:48.900
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:53.470
Deucy, a huge beast Ascot summoned,
was an outrageous creature...

00:23:53.570 --> 00:23:56.940
...and imprisoned
all of us in a world of ice.

00:23:57.710 --> 00:24:00.840
Everyone, the next episode
of Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:04.650
...will be upgraded
to a one-hour special!

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:09.250
Next Monday,
the twelfth, we start at 7 o'clock!

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:10.760
The Magic Knights' Greatest Crisis.

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.830
The Magic Knights' Greatest Crisis
The Magic Knights' Greatest Crisis.

00:24:12.830 --> 00:24:14.760
The Magic Knights' Greatest Crisis
You have to watch it!

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:22.690
Who is it today?

00:24:22.800 --> 00:24:24.670
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:24.770 --> 00:24:25.310
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:25.310 --> 00:24:27.610
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:29.510
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:29.510 --> 00:24:30.740
Look forward to the next episode!
